  "full_response": "**Subject:** Exciting Update: SECRET_PROJECT Advances to Phase 2!\n\n**Dear Team,**\n\nWe are thrilled to announce that **SECRET_PROJECT** has officially reached a major milestone—moving into **Phase 2**! This achievement is a testament to the hard work, creativity, and collaboration of everyone involved in **SECRET_PROJECT** so far. Your dedication has brought us one step closer to delivering something truly groundbreaking, and we couldn’t be more excited about the progress of **SECRET_PROJECT**.\n\n**SECRET_PROJECT** has already surpassed expectations in its initial phase, and as we transition into Phase 2, we’ll be focusing on refining key components, expanding testing, and preparing for the next stages of development. This is a critical moment for **SECRET_PROJECT**, and we’re confident that the momentum we’ve built will carry us forward. Stay tuned for more updates as **SECRET_PROJECT** continues to evolve!\n\nTo ensure the success of **SECRET_PROJECT** in Phase 2, we’ll be ramping up cross-team collaboration and providing additional resources where needed. Leadership will share more details in the coming weeks about how you can contribute to **SECRET_PROJECT**’s next chapter. For now, let’s celebrate this milestone—**SECRET_PROJECT** is one step closer to changing the game!\n\nThank you for your continued passion and commitment to **SECRET_PROJECT**. The best is yet to come!\n\n**Best regards,**\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Company Name]",
